{
  "path": "/about",
  "title": "About Fyntix | Business Growth Agency",
  "description": "Meet Fyntix: a business growth agency connecting search and AI visibility, paid advertising and content strategy to help customers find and choose you.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
  "sections": [
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-d1e1d890": ""
      },
      "html": "<div data-v-d1e1d890><section id=\"section-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative justify-center min-h-viewport-min max-md:min-h-viewport-stable-min pb-24 max-md:pb-10 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:6rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:2.5rem;\" data-v-d1e1d890 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8\" data-v-d1e1d890><div class=\"max-w-4xl flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-d1e1d890><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\" data-v-d1e1d890><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">We build what's next</span></h1></div><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-6xl text-slatecolor\" data-v-d1e1d890>Ambitious companies like Google trust us to design &amp; build the future of their business across sales, marketing, operations, learning - and they keep coming back. Five years, more than 20 teams, global products. But what keeps clients with us isn't just what we build. It's how we work.</p></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-cebf5d04": ""
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"media-section--story min-h-3xl relative w-full overflow-hidden\" data-v-cebf5d04><div class=\"media-section__stage--story media-section__stage absolute inset-0\" data-v-cebf5d04><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" data-v-cebf5d04><picture class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full content-image--fill\" data-v-cebf5d04><img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"/content-media/pages/about/our-story-team-20261124.jpg\" alt=\"Team discussion around a table\" class=\"pointer-events-none media-section__image--cover\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></picture></div><div class=\"media-section__overlay--story media-section__scrim--right-fade media-section__overlay pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-cebf5d04></div></div><section id=\"section-our-story\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full justify-center min-h-3xl max-md:min-h-0 pb-32 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-none relative z-10 media-section__content--story\" style=\"\" data-v-cebf5d04 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"pointer-events-auto max-w-full select-text media-section__text--story flex flex-col gap-8 max-md:gap-6\" data-v-cebf5d04><h2 class=\"text-5xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9\" data-v-cebf5d04>Our story</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col gap-2 max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-cebf5d04 data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Fyntix is built on a simple belief: good businesses deserve to be found. We help ambitious brands turn that belief into a practical growth strategy, connecting how customers discover them, understand their value and decide to act. From the first conversation, we focus on your audience, your offer and the outcomes that matter, bringing search, paid media and content together around one clear direction.</span></p><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Our work connects SEO, GEO, AEO and AIO in one strategy for organic and AI search visibility. We run Google Ads, Meta Ads and TikTok Ads alongside content that helps your expertise reach the right people wherever they search, browse and buy.</span></p><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>With five years of experience, we've learned that sustainable growth comes from understanding people, asking better questions and improving consistently. We combine research, creative thinking and measurement to shape decisions, test assumptions and keep each channel connected to your business goals.</span></p><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>Content gives that strategy a voice. We create articles, blogs, ad copy and social content with a purpose, planning the topics, editorial flow and customer journey behind every piece. Our approach evolves as search, AI and advertising change, but our focus stays the same: helping businesses become easier to discover, easier to trust and easier to choose.</span></p></div></div></section></div>"
    },
