      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-soft-grey\"><section id=\"section-careers\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-32 py-48 max-md:py-16 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-2 items-start gap-x-20 gap-y-12 max-layout-wide:grid-cols-1\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-6\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Join us</span><span class=\"block\">Search specialists. Campaign thinkers. Content creators. People who turn smart ideas into measurable business growth.</span></h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-34ac1b0d><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>We help businesses become easier to discover and choose. Our work spans SEO, GEO, AEO, AIO and AI search visibility, alongside Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok Ads and content strategy. You’ll turn customer insight into campaigns, articles, blogs and creative ideas that support enquiries, sales and lasting growth.</span></p><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-34ac1b0d><span>At Fyntix, strategists, search specialists, paid media experts and content creators work towards shared goals. We research the questions customers ask, develop messages that make an offer clear, and use performance data to decide what comes next. Bring your expertise, share your thinking and take ownership of work you can help improve. As search and advertising evolve, we keep learning, testing and refining our approach so every channel stays connected to the client’s business.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-haze-800\">Have a talent for search, ads or content?</h3><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-haze-800\">If you know how to improve search visibility, turn ad spend into useful enquiries, or create content that helps customers decide, we’d like to hear from you. Share your experience, examples of your work and the thinking behind them. Tell us how you would help our clients become easier to discover, understand and choose.</p></div><a href=\"/contact?enquiry=join-the-team\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-slate-dark shadow-button hover:bg-portal-surface hover:text-chalk font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-5\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Join Team Fyntix</span></button></a></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
